// 2011's, every row: the 2011 wiki as it stood on 23 May 2011.
// - minutes, points, summon_xp, hitpoints: "Summoning familiars" (Time, Point Cost, XP, LP).
// - create_xp: "Summoning pouches" (Create XP), last edited 11 May 2011.
// - scroll_create_xp, scroll_use_xp, special_cost: "Summoning scrolls" (Experience: Creating,
//   Using; Special move points), last edited 17 Apr 2011. Where that page and the familiars page
//   disagree on a scroll's xp, the scrolls page is used.
// - bob_slots: "Beast of Burden", last edited 17 Apr 2011.
// pouch, npc, npc_combat and scroll are cache 786's: enums 1320 and 1283, and the combat form is
// the npc after the familiar's. Beaver, macaw, magpie, ibis and fruit bat have no combat form.
// No source found: the phoenix's scroll xp and cost (the scrolls page has no row for it).
// Rows are generated: join of those pages with the cache by familiar name.

// Spirit wolf, level 1.
